are-jaya-gaura-sarasvati/","title":"Śrī Sāraswat-ārati"},"next":{"path":"/lv/namo-namah-tulasi-maharani/","title":"Śrī Tulasī-parikramā-gīti"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":68,"first_line":"gurudeva kṛpā-bindu diyā"},"title":["Gurudeva"],"author":["Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs"],"verses":[{"text":["gurudeva!","kṛpā-bindu diyā, koro’ ei dāse,","tṛṇāpekṣā ati dīna","sakala-sahane, bolo diyā koro,","nija-māne spṛhā-hīna"],"translation":["Gurudēv, ak, dāvā man, tavam kalpam, kaut pilienu savas žēlastības. Es esmu zemāks par zāles stiebru! Es tevi lūdzu, palīdzi man un dod man spēku. Lai es, līdzīgi tev, atbrīvotos no visām savām savtīgajām vēlmēm un tieksmēm!"],"isLong":false},{"text":["sakale sammān, korite śakati,","deho nātha! jathā jatha","tobe to’ gāibo, harināma-sukhe,","aparādha hobe hoto"],"translation":["Iemāci mani izrādīt katram piedienīgu cieņu! Tad, pateicoties Svētā Vārda dziedāšanai, visi mani apvainojumi tiks pilnībā iznīcināti!"],"isLong":false},{"text":["kobe heno kṛpā, lobhiyā e jana,","kṛtārtha hoibe, nātha!","śakti-buddhi-hīn, āmi ati dīn,","koro more ātma-sātha"],"translation":["Ak, mans valdniek! Kad gan tava žēlastība nāks pār to, kurš ir zaudējis prātu, kurš ir ļoti vājš un bezpalīdzīgs. Lūdzu, ļauj man būt tev blakus!"],"isLong":false},{"text":["jogyatā-vichāre, kichu nāhi pāi,","tomāra koruṇā-sāra","koruṇā nā hoile, kā̐diyā kā̐diyā,","prāṇa nā rākhibo āra"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sridhar-maharaj-and-govinda-6","personSlug":"srila-b-r-sridhar-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-gurudev-kripa","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-gurudev-morning","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-gurudev","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-utrennee-2","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/43-gurudeva-krpa-bindu-diya","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gurudev-kripa-bindu-diya","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-gurudev","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Gurudeva-03-14"},"head":{"canonical":"/lv/gurudeva-kripa-bindu-diya-kara-ei-dase/","description":"Gurudeva — vaišnavu dziesma ar vārdiem, tulkojumu latviešu valodā un skaidrojumu vārdu pa vārdam. Autors — Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs. No grāmatas «Gaudija Gītandžalī».","title":"Gurudeva. Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"lv","slug":"gurudeva-kripa-bindu-diya-kara-ei-dase"}}